[resource]
script = ExtResource("1")
title = "Expeditions"
brief_tooltip = "[Coming Soon]
Send groups south to find rescue.
Requires sled with supplies."
implemented = false
detailed_text = "[b]Expeditions — Coming Soon[/b]

[i]Crozier's actual plan was to lead his men south to Back's Fish River, over 300 kilometres away, hoping to reach a Hudson's Bay Company outpost. None of them made it.[/i]

Assemble a party, load a sled with supplies, and send them south across King William Island to find rescue.

• Outfit an expedition with food, fuel, and tents for a multi-day journey
• Discover points of interest along the route
• Reach the HBC outpost on the south coast to secure rescue early

Finding the outpost is your best chance. Without it, you are simply waiting and hoping the rescue timer runs out before your supplies do."
